msgid ""
"An approved or disbursed loan cannot be freely recalculated. Use an "
"authorized restructuring instead."
msgstr ""
"Un crédito aprobado o desembolsado no puede recalcularse libremente. Usa una"
" reestructuración autorizada."

msgid "The schedule cannot be rebuilt: the loan already has payments applied."
msgstr ""
"No se puede regenerar el calendario: el crédito ya tiene pagos aplicados."

msgid "The customer is restricted. Review their history before approving."
msgstr "El cliente está restringido. Revisa su historial antes de aprobar."

msgid "Only an approved loan can be disbursed."
msgstr "Solo se puede desembolsar un crédito aprobado."

msgid "A settled loan cannot be cancelled."
msgstr "Un crédito liquidado no se puede cancelar."

msgid ""
"The loan has payments applied. Reverse the payments before cancelling or "
"register a restructuring."
msgstr ""
"El crédito tiene pagos aplicados. Reversa los pagos antes de cancelar o "
"registra una reestructuración."

msgid "You must state the reason for the cancellation."
msgstr "Debes indicar el motivo de la cancelación."

msgid "Only a live loan can be restructured."
msgstr "Solo se reestructura un crédito vigente."

msgid "The loan has no outstanding balance to restructure."
msgstr "El crédito no tiene saldo pendiente que reestructurar."

msgid "The customer is flagged as RESTRICTED."
